pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: top-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 6]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: dir-badge-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 10, 80, 20]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: dir-badge-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 10, 80, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        Ch04
  - elementId: ev-badge-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [1060, 10, 160, 20]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: ev-badge-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1060, 10, 160, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        E1 / Peer-reviewed
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 36, 990, 42]
    content:
      fontSize: 32
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>RContainer: CCA 安全容器 — 内容摘要</strong></p>
  - elementId: title-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 80, 120, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 92, 1160, 590]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>把 Arm CCA 扩展到安全容器架构，面向云原生场景重构容器隔离边界。</p>
        <p>RContainer 是面向 CCA 安全容器的代表性改进系统，利用 CCA 硬件原语为容器 workload 建立更强机密性边界，同时保留容器化部署模型。将 CCA 从 confidential VM 推向容器 workload，贴近云原生落地场景。</p>
        <p>论文定位：代表性改进；材料类型：系统论文；证据等级：E1 / 同行评审改进证据。</p>
  - elementId: source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 690, 1160, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        来源：RContainer: CCA 安全容器｜证据等级：E1 / Peer-reviewed SOTA
  - elementId: bottom-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 714, 1280, 6]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
